Package: endogCopulaPanel
Type: Package
Title: Panel Gaussian Copula Endogeneity Correction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Ashwin", family = "Malshe", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ashwin@malshe.com")
Description: Implements the fixed-effects panel 'Gaussian copula' estimator of
    Haschka (2022) <doi:10.1177/00222437211070820>, ported from the published
    replication code into a standalone package. The estimator corrects for
    endogenous regressors in linear fixed-effects panel models without
    instrumental variables by transforming the data via forward orthogonal
    deviations and jointly estimating the regression and the copula dependence
    between the error and the endogenous regressors by maximum likelihood, with
    bootstrap standard errors computed in parallel.
